     C*
     C* RPG/400 calculation specifications. Every operation code in
     C* Table 35 of the reference appears at least once.
     C*
     C* Member: RPGCAL   Compilable: no (calculations only, no files)
     C* Source: RPG/400 Reference SC09-1817, chapters 9 and 11
     C*         (Tables 26 and 35).
     C* Retrieved: 2026-07-26
     C*
     C* 7-8 control level  9-17 conditioning indicators
     C* 18-27 factor 1  28-32 operation  33-42 factor 2
     C* 43-48 result  49-51 length  52 decimals  53 extender
     C* 54-59 resulting indicators  60-80 comments
     C*  1         2         3         4         5         6         7         8
     C*8901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890
     C*
     C* A /COPY among the calculations carries C in position 6.
     C/COPY QRPGSRC,PAYSUBR
     C*
     C* Control level: blank detail, L0 total, L1-L9 control break,
     C* LR last record, SR subroutine, AN and OR continuation.
     CL0         GRAND     ADD  PAGE      GRAND
     CL1         LVLTOT    ADD  AMOUNT    LVLTOT
     CL9                   Z-ADD*ZERO     LVLTOT
     CLR                   EXSR FINAL
     CSR         *BLANKS   MOVE           MSG
     C*
     C* Conditioning indicators, three per line, N to test for off.
     C   01      'Y'       MOVE           FOUND
     C  N01 H1NMR'N'       MOVE           FOUND
     C   KA KN KY          SETON                         RT
     C   U1 OA OV          EXCPT
     C   LRNL1 RT          SETOF                     20
     CAN 02      'X'       MOVE           FLAG
     COR 03      'Z'       MOVE           FLAG
     C*
     C* Arithmetic operations.
     C           QTYORD    ADD  QTYSHP    QTYTOT  70 202122
     C           QTYORD    SUB  QTYSHP    QTYBAK  70
     C           QTYTOT    MULT PRICE     AMOUNT  92H
     C           AMOUNT    DIV  QTYTOT    UNIT    94H
     C                     MVR            REMAIN  94
     C                     Z-ADD*ZERO     AMOUNT
     C                     Z-SUBAMOUNT    CREDIT  92
     C                     SQRT AREA      SIDE    73
     C                     XFOOTTOTALS    GRAND  112
     C*
     C* Move and move zone operations.
     C           *BLANKS   MOVE           CUSTNM
     C           'PENDING' MOVEL          STATUS 10
     C           FLAGS     MOVEA          HOLD   99
     C           ZONEA     MHHZO          ZONEB
     C           ZONEA     MHLZO          ZONEB
     C           ZONEA     MLHZO          ZONEB
     C           ZONEA     MLLZO          ZONEB
     C*
     C* String operations.
     C           FIRST     CAT  LAST:1    FULLNM 30
     C           6         SUBSTFULLNM:1  PREFIX  6 P
     C           ','       SCAN FULLNM    POSN    30     30
     C           '01234'   CHECKDIGITS    POSN           31
     C           ' '       CHEKRFULLNM    POSN           32
     C           LOW:UPP   XLATEFULLNM    FULLNM    P
     C*
     C* Bit and test operations.
     C                     BITON'01234567'MASK
     C                     BITOF'07'      MASK
     C                     TESTB'0'       MASK       404142
     C                     TESTN          NUMFLD     434445
     C                     TESTZ          ALPFLD     464748
     C*
     C* Compare and branching operations.
     C           QTYORD    COMP QTYSHP               505152
     C           QTYORD    CABGTQTYSHP    OVER       50
     C           QTYORD    CABEQQTYSHP    SAME
     C           QTYORD    CAB  QTYSHP    ALWAYS
     C                     GOTO ENDTAG
     C           OVER      TAG
     C           SAME      TAG
     C           ALWAYS    TAG
     C           ENDTAG    TAG
     C*
     C* Structured groups. The xx suffix is GT LT EQ NE GE or LE.
     C           QTYORD    IFGT *ZERO
     C           QTYORD    ANDLEMAXQTY
     C           STATUS    ORNE 'C'
     C           'Y'       MOVE           VALID
     C                     ELSE
     C           'N'       MOVE           VALID
     C                     ENDIF
     C           1         DO   10        IDX     30
     C                     ITER
     C                     LEAVE
     C                     ENDDO
     C           IDX       DOWLTMAXIDX
     C           1         ADD  IDX
     C                     ENDDO
     C           IDX       DOUGEMAXIDX
     C           1         SUB  IDX
     C                     END                             END closes a group
     C                     SELEC
     C           STATUS    WHEQ 'A'
     C           'ACTIVE'  MOVE           STSDSC
     C           STATUS    WHNE 'A'
     C           'CLOSED'  MOVE           STSDSC
     C                     OTHER
     C           *BLANKS   MOVE           STSDSC
     C                     ENDSL
     C*
     C* Subroutines and the CAS group.
     C           STATUS    CASEQ'A'       ACTSR
     C           STATUS    CASNE'A'       CLSSR
     C                     CAS            DFTSR
     C                     ENDCS
     C                     EXSR ACTSR
     CSR         ACTSR     BEGSR
     C           'A'       MOVE           STATUS
     CSR                   ENDSR
     CSR         CLSSR     BEGSR
     CSR         RETPT     ENDSR*GETIN
     CSR         *PSSR     BEGSR
     CSR                   ENDSR*CANCL
     CSR         *INZSR    BEGSR
     CSR                   ENDSR
     C*
     C* File operations.
     C           ORDKEY    CHAINORDHDR               60
     C                     READ ORDHDR                 6162
     C           ORDKEY    READEORDDTL                   63
     C                     READPORDHDR                   64
     C           ORDKEY    REDPEORDDTL                   65
     C                     READCSFLREC                   66
     C           ORDKEY    SETLLORDHDR               676869
     C           ORDKEY    SETGTORDHDR               70
     C                     WRITEORDDTL                 71
     C                     UPDATORDHDR                 72
     C           ORDKEY    DELETORDHDR               7374
     C                     EXCPTHEADNG
     C                     EXFMTCUSTFMT                75
     C                     OPEN ORDHDR                 76
     C                     CLOSEORDHDR                 77
     C                     FEOD ORDHDR                 78
     C                     FORCEORDSEC
     C           DEVICE    NEXT CUSTDSP                79
     C           DEVICE    POST CUSTDSP                80
     C           DEVICE    ACQ  CUSTDSP                81
     C           DEVICE    REL  CUSTDSP                82
     C                     UNLCKORDHDR                 83
     C           BOUNDRY   COMIT                       84
     C                     ROLBK                       85
     C*
     C* Key lists and parameter lists.
     C           ORDKEY    KLIST
     C                     KFLD           ORDCO
     C                     KFLD           ORDNBR
     C           SPCPLS    PLIST
     C                     PARM           PARM1
     C           FROMFL    PARM TOFLD     PARM2
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     C                     PARM           INCUST  6
     C                     CALL 'PAYCALC'              86
     C                     CALL PGMNAM    SPCPLS       87
     C                     FREE 'PAYCALC'              88
     C*
     C* Data area, occurrence and definition operations.
     C           *LIKE     DEFN ORDAMT    WRKAMT
     C           *NAMVAR   DEFN *LDA      LDADS
     C           *LOCK     IN   LDADS                  89
     C                     OUT  LDADS                  90
     C                     UNLCKLDADS                  91
     C           IDX       OCUR MULTDS    CUROCC     9293
     C                     CLEARORDDS
     C                     RESETORDDS
     C           *NOKEY    CLEARCUSTFMT
     C*
     C* Indicator, information and array operations.
     C                     SETON                     2021LR
     C                     SETOF                     202122
     C                     SETON                     KAKNKY
     C                     SETON                     L1OAU1
     C                     TIME           NOWTIM  60
     C                     TIME           NOWTS  120
     C           'GO?'     DSPLY*EXT      ANSWER
     C           'DBG1'    DEBUGQSYSPRT   DBGFLD
     C           'DMP1'    DUMP
     C                     SHTDN                     94
     C           SRCHKY    LOKUPTABPRT               95  96
     C                     SORTATOTALS
     C*
     C* Comments run from position 60. A page and line number in
     C* positions 1-5 does not disturb the columns.
     C                     RETRN                           Return to the caller
     C                     SETON                         LREnd of program
06010C           *BLANKS   MOVE           MSG              Clear message
